overSelectHighlightRed SCXW172892433 BCX8&quot;&gt;experts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun TrackChangeHoverSelectHighlightRed SCXW172892433 BCX8&quot;&gt; and techno-economic modellers work alongside governments, regulators, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun TrackChangeHoverSelectHighlightRed SCXW172892433 BCX8&quot;&gt;investors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun TrackChangeHoverSelectHighlightRed SCXW172892433 BCX8&quot;&gt; and corporates — shaping &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange TrackChangeHoverSelectColorRed SCXW172892433 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW172892433 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun TrackChangeHoverSelectHighlightRed SCXW172892433 BCX8&quot;&gt;regulatory and policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange TrackChangeHoverSelectColorRed SCXW172892433 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW172892433 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun TrackChangeHoverSelectHighlightRed SCXW172892433 BCX8&quot;&gt; frameworks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange TrackChangeHoverSelectColorRed SCXW172892433 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW172892433 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun TrackChangeHoverSelectHighlightRed SCXW172892433 BCX8&quot;&gt;, as well as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TrackChangeTextInsertion TrackedChange TrackChangeHoverSelectColorRed SCXW172892433 BCX8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW172892433 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun TrackChangeHoverSelectHighlightRed SCXW172892433 BCX8&