description_html:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Do you thrive in a fast-paced environment where you can take on responsibility from day one? Do you want to be part of an ambitious, entrepreneurial team? And are you excited about building a successful career in sales?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Retail Insights is Northern Europe’s leading retail forum. We are strengthening the retail ecosystem by building a platform for insights, inspiration, and networking, connecting more than 3,000 leaders yearly from more than 15 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Retail Insights is part of United Media which focuses on building large scale industry media and conferences products in sectors such as insurance, HR, private equity, retail, etc. As of today, we have organically launched 8 media companies and acquired one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we offer you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to build exceptional sales skills while helping us grow some of the world&#39;s leading business conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join our London team and receive the training, coaching and responsibility to accelerate your development from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training &amp;amp; Coaching:&lt;/strong&gt; Ongoing feedback and support from our leadership team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Uncapped earning potential&lt;/strong&gt;. Competitive base salary plus an attractive commission structure where your results directly impact your earnings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International exposure:&lt;/strong&gt; Speak with senior executives, investors and business leaders from around the world and attend our international conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fast career progression:&lt;/strong&gt; We promote internally and give high performers significant responsibility early in their careers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;25 days&#39; holiday.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great team culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Regular team socials, lunches and events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission will be to drive revenue by selling delegate passes to senior professionals attending our international conferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive new business:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively reach out to prospective delegates and convert them into paying attendees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your targets:&lt;/strong&gt; Take responsibility for ambitious monthly revenue goals and work towards exceeding them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute high-volume outreach: &lt;/strong&gt;Generating qualified sales opportunities and proposals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage your pipeline:&lt;/strong&gt; Own prospects from first conversation through follow-up, proposal and close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Become an expert:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a strong understanding of our conferences, audiences and industries so you can sell with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we expect from you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most importantly, you &lt;em&gt;want to sell.&lt;/em&gt; You enjoy speaking with people, working towards ambitious targets and the feeling of turning an opportunity into a closed deal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who has:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At least 1 year of B2B sales experience&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally involving outbound prospecting, new business or a high-volume sales environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive &amp;amp; ambition:&lt;/strong&gt; You are highly motivated, competitive and want to perform at a high level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You are energised by targets, revenue and the opportunity to directly influence your earnings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resilience:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable with outbound activity and have the persistence to keep going when you hear &quot;no&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong communication skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You are confident speaking with new people and can build rapport quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You take responsibility for your targets, pipeline and follow-ups.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You actively seek feedback and continuously look for ways to improve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from recent graduates and early-career professionals, provided you have at least one year of B2B sales experience and can demonstrate the drive, communication skills and competitive mindset needed to succeed in a high-performance sales environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start date:&lt;/strong&gt; As soon as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monday–Friday, we work from our &lt;strong&gt;WeWork office in Victoria, London&lt;/strong&gt;. Due to the collaborative nature of our work, we do not offer remote work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You must have the right to work in the UK.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

