&lt;h2&gt;About CarbonChain&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The fight against Climate Change is evolving rapidly. Climate tech is changing. The first wave was reporting. The next is treating carbon the way companies treat money:&amp;nbsp;as a way to&amp;nbsp;decide what to buy, who to sell to, and which incentives to claim.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Around the world, carbon is becoming a condition of trade. Border taxes, free allocations, green premiums, cheaper capital. It looks a lot like the post-war&amp;nbsp;rebuild:&amp;nbsp;governments put capital and tax incentives on the table, and the companies that could keep the books moved first. The missing piece then was bookkeeping. The missing piece now is the same, carbon accounting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;CarbonChain&amp;nbsp;is that bookkeeping. We turn messy, real-world supply-chain data into numbers a trader, a sustainability lead, or a CFO will&amp;nbsp;actually use.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We want people who are agents of change, who feel the impact of climate change and know there is no way around it to create a better future for every being.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;People who know the customer is the truth of how a company thrives. People who treat data as the fuel for how fast society can change. People who use AI to accelerate the cause for good by working through an AI lens first to automate repetitive tasks and analyse data. Finally, people who enjoy working with people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Product&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We help the world&#39;s largest commodity producers and traders measure and cut emissions, with verified primary data where we can get it and defensible defaults where we cannot. The platform turns operational and supplier files into decision-grade carbon and compliance insight: sourcing, CBAM, product and corporate footprints, reporting customers and regulators will stand behind.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We organise carbon accounting around the user in four contexts at once:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Immediate:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;the tools in front of them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Internal:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;how they work with colleagues&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;External:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;how they work with suppliers and customers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Societal:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;how they work with society, governments, and disclosing bodies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The data we hold is only useful if it makes all four of those jobs easier.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Reporting to the Head of Operations and partnering closely with the founders and technical leadership, the Head of Talent Acquisition will assume full ownership of the talent acquisition function during a critical period of growth. This is a hands-on appointment, combining strategic responsibility for the hiring roadmap with direct delivery against a defined set&amp;nbsp;of vacancies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The role carries a clearly defined mandate: the successful appointment will lead the recruitment of&amp;nbsp;approximately 5-8&amp;nbsp;senior engineering&amp;nbsp;and product hires over the contract term, while simultaneously professionalising the&amp;nbsp;recruitment&amp;nbsp;systems, processes and capability that will underpin the company&#39;s hiring beyond it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:260,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Developing and delivering a talent acquisition strategy aligned to the organisation&#39;s growth ambitions and headcount plan&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Partnering with the senior leadership team and hiring managers to define role requirements, success profiles and structured scorecards for each vacancy &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Taking direct ownership of senior technical recruitment, including proactive sourcing, candidate engagement, assessment and offer management &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Designing and embedding a consistent, structured interview process, including interviewer training and calibration for hiring managers across the business &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Reducing reliance on external recruitment agencies through the development of direct sourcing capability and a sustainable talent pipeline &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Championing an outstanding candidate experience and acting as a credible ambassador for the CarbonChain brand in a competitive technical market &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Leading offer negotiation and closing activity, including compensation benchmarking and equity discussions appropriate to the company&#39;s stage &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Optimising the applicant tracking system and establishing meaningful reporting on pipeline health, time to hire, source effectiveness and cost per hire &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Delivering a documented talent acquisition playbook and comprehensive handover to enable the business to operate the function effectively at the conclusion of the contract&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:90}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Measures of success&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:260,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;12&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Delivery of the agreed engineering and product vacancies within the contract term&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;12&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A reduction in median time from first candidate contact to offer to under 45 days. A demonstrable reduction in agency expenditure, with the majority of hires delivered through direct and referred channels &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;12&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Structured scorecards and interview loops in place and in active use across all open roles &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;12&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A documented playbook, an accurate applicant tracking system and a warm pipeline in place at handover&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:90}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Successful Applicant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335572079&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335572080&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335572081&amp;quot;:4021279,&amp;quot;469789806&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;single&amp;quot;}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The successful candidate will be an accomplished in-house talent acquisition professional with a strong&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of senior technical hiring in a high-growth, venture-backed environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You will&amp;nbsp;likely bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:260,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;16&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Proven ownership of engineering and product recruitment&amp;nbsp;for 5y+&amp;nbsp;within seed to Series B technology businesses, including successful delivery of senior,&amp;nbsp;staff&amp;nbsp;and lead-level appointments&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;16&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Demonstrable direct sourcing expertise, with the ability to personally generate and convert pipeline for hard-to-fill technical roles &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;16&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience of designing and implementing structured interview processes and scorecards in organisations where these were not previously established &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;16&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills, with the credibility and confidence to challenge and shape hiring manager requirements &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;16&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Comfort operating as a standalone function, balancing strategic responsibility with hands-on operational delivery &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;16&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A strong working knowledge of the UK technology talent market, including compensation benchmarking, notice periods and visa sponsorship&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:90}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Desirable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:260,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;22&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Prior experience within climate technology,&amp;nbsp;B2B SaaS, data&amp;nbsp;infrastructure&amp;nbsp;or financial technology&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;22&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A background in recruiting full stack engineers and product managers &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;22&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Previous contract or interim experience, with a proven ability to mobilise quickly and hand over effectively &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;22&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience of successfully transitioning an organisation from agency-led to direct hiring &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;22&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Track record of taking/developing job specs and role briefs quickly and generating candidate pipeline quickly. Not having 30 days to build beautiful processes and &#39;then&#39; recruit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;22&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Familiarity in Greenhouse.com as an ATS, we’ve been using it for 6 years and have lot of existing data to leverage &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;22&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Willingness to support the ad hoc sourcing of non-tech roles from time to time together with the Head of Operations.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:90}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;How We Work&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As a hybrid co-located team,&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;inspired by our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.carbonchain.com/interview-process&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and anchored in hubs across the UK and US. This role would be located 3d/week in our London LABS Camden office space.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW253610664 BCX0&quot;&gt;The in-office requirement reflects the collaborative nature of the appointment: the successful candidate will work in close partnership with hiring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW253610664 BCX0&quot;&gt;managers,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW253610664 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;lead interview debriefs in person and host candidates on site throughout the process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;29&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;A day rate of £550 – £650, outside IR35, dependent on experience&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;29&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;An initial 6-month contract, with a potential opportunity to extend to 12 months &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;29&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A newly created appointment with full autonomy and a clearly defined mandate &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;29&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Direct exposure to the founders and senior leadership team of a well-funded, high-growth business &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;29&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The opportunity to contribute to a business with a substantive and measurable climate impact &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Aptos&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551500&amp;quot;:2055229,&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:403,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:259,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;29&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A collaborative London-based culture, including quarterly team offsites, regular team lunches and a well-established social calendar&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:90}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:90}&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Process&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The recruitment process&amp;nbsp;comprises:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559684&amp;quot;:-2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;an initial&amp;nbsp;competency-based discussion covering&amp;nbsp;previous&amp;nbsp;hiring delivery&amp;nbsp;conversation with the Head of Operations&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559684&amp;quot;:-2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;a working session with a hiring manager based on a live vacancy, and&amp;nbsp; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559683&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559684&amp;quot;:-2,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;a final conversation with the founders &lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:140}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The business intends to conclude the process within two weeks and to provide feedback within 48 hours of the final stage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:90}&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;CarbonChain values diversity and inclusion and welcomes applications from candidates with diverse backgrounds.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you think your skills and experience match what we’re looking for and you’d like to join the next Climate Tech industry unicorn, please get in touch!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You can find out more about interviewing at CarbonChain at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.carbonchain.com/careers/interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.carbonchain.com/careers/interview-process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

